    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "AAAAcn//4F0\u003d",
        "filename": "common/led_common.c",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 17,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000187
      },
      "writtenOn": "2013-08-06T15:16:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "For persistent state within a file, yes.\n\nFor constant data (such as the GPIO list in board.c), yes.\n\nTo pass information between files, no.\n\nSo\n static yes\n const yes\n neither static nor const, no.",
      "parentUuid": "AAAAcn//4Ho\u003d",
      "revId": "cf9a65003fe24212ff4500b9ee7436be0038e1bd",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": false
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "AAAAcn//4Hk\u003d",
        "filename": "common/led_common.c",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 45,
      "author": {
        "id": 1001853
      },
      "writtenOn": "2013-08-06T13:42:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "How about params and response?\nVery short variable names are generally discouraged unless for quite short loop.",
      "revId": "cf9a65003fe24212ff4500b9ee7436be0038e1bd",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": false
    },
    {
