        "id": 1000187
      },
      "writtenOn": "2013-08-06T15:16:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Here it\u0027s a tradeoff between having the short variable names (p, r) and the long member names inside the variables (brightness_range), and the 80-character line limit.\n\nBut yes, in general we go with longer variable names.",
